#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0342 expect=violation domain=ADLBC
# Rule:Description: Within a parameter, there is more than one value of ANRLO for a given value of ANRLOC
#expectViolationCount 2
#expectViolationAt row=1
#expectViolationAt row=2
dataset ADLBC
col PARAMCD type=Char
col ANRLO type=Char
col ANRLOC type=Char
---
HEIGHT | Label A | A
HEIGHT | Different Label | A
HEIGHT | Label B | B
---
